FRED BREEDS IT AS A SIDE JOB.

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.092 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HE SEEMED UNCOMFORTABLE AND

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:27.694 line:0%
NERVOUS AND FIDGETY.

