THAT'S WHEN I STARTED GETTING

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.696 line:0%
SUSPICIOUS.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:32.532 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HIS INSTINCT WAS CORRECT.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.033 line:0%
THESE ARE NINE CHECKS FROM

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.301 line:0%
