FRED AND OTHER AMISH DOG

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.775 line:0%
BREEDERS.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:42.175 line:0%
THEY TOTALED MORE THAN 50,000

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:46.246 line:0%
DOLLAR.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.248 line:0%
FRED SAYS THE MAN HE THEN U.S.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.681 line:0%
GEORGE CAME WITH A FEMALE

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:50.950 line:0%
ASSISTANT.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.718 line:0%
THEY CUT THEIR DEAL IN THIS

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.252 line:0%
VERY ROOM WE ARE STANDING, IN

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.187 line:0%
THE MILK HOUSE.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:54.754 line:0%
HE SAYS THE MAN WANTED TWO

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.489 line:0%
GERMAN SHEPHERDS.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:57.190 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HE SAYS, OKAY, WE WILL TAKE

