00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.766 line:0%
HE PULLS OUT A CHECK.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:08.334 line:0%
I WAS LIKE, OH NO, IS THIS GUY

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:11.604 line:0%
GOING TO PAY ME WITH A CHECK?

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:13.006 line:0%
BY THEN, I WAS VERY SUSPICIOUS.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:15.608 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU TOLD ME BEFORE, SHE PUT

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.042 line:0%
THE DOGS IN THE CAR, CORRECT?

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:16.643 line:0%
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:17.077 line:0%
&gt;&gt; BEFORE THEY PAID?

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:20.146 line:0%
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.880 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE SUSPICIOUS BECAUSE

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.247 line:0%
HE IS GOING TO PAY WITH THAT

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.348 line:0%
CHECK.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.317 line:0%
YOU DON'T TAKE CHECKS.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:26.553 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I TOLD HIM I DON'T TAKE

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:29.722 line:0%
CHECKS, ALL I CAN TAKE IS CASH.

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:31.691 line:0%
HE SAID, WOULD YOU EXPECT ME TO

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.492 line:0%
CARRY ENOUGH CASH TO BUY A

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:32.859 line:0%
BUNCH OF PUPPIES ON A TRIP LIKE

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.527 line:0%
THIS?

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.295 line:0%
I DO NOT HAVE CASH.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.162 line:0%
THE ONLY THING I CAN GIVE YOU

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:40.233 line:0%
IS THE CHECK.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:42.001 line:0%
WELL, I THOUGHT TO MYSELF, IT

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.003 line:0%
LOOKS LIKE I AM DUMB.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.504 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I'M STUCK.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.407 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I'M STUCK.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:48.575 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE DOGS ARE IN THE CAR.

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:48.942 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU THOUGHT THEY PULLED A

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.844 line:0%
FAST?

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:53.513 line:0%
ONE &gt;&gt; IT WAS OBVIOUS TO ME BY

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.414 line:0%
