00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.549 line:0%
PULLED A FAST ONE.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.617 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SO YOU SAID, THROUGH THE

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:59.519 line:0%
GOODNESS OF YOUR HEART, I TAKE

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.886 line:0%
IT, THAT YOU WILL TAKE THE

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:00.653 line:0%
CHECK.

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:01.955 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I SAID, I DECIDED THE CHECK

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.856 line:0%
IS BETTER THAN NOTHING.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:07.927 line:0%
I WILL GIVE IT A TRY.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.561 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE RESULT OF THAT DRY?

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:09.329 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE CHECK BOUNCED.

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:14.000 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THEN YOU ARE CHARGED A FEE

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:14.801 line:0%
FOR DEPOSITING A BOUNCED CHECK.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:15.535 line:0%
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:15.902 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HAVE YOU GOTTEN THE MONEY

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:16.269 line:0%
BACK?

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:18.238 line:0%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:18.938 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HAVE YOU HEARD FROM ANYBODY?

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.973 line:0%
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:20.940 line:0%
&gt;&gt; MR. SANTOS?

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.041 line:0%
&gt;&gt; JUST THREE DAYS AFTER THESE

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:24.077 line:0%
PUPPIES WERE PURPOSE, SANTOS

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:26.146 line:0%
