00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:27.380 line:0%
EVENT AT A STORE IN STATEN

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.414 line:0%
ISLAND, NEW YORK, ACCORDING TO

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:31.918 line:0%
A FORMER OWNER OF THE BUSINESS.

