THAT MAN, DANIEL, TELLS CNN HE

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:35.989 line:0%
WROTE A CHECK FOR A FEW HUNDRED

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.824 line:0%
DOLLARS TO SANTOS'S PAST RESCUE

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:39.392 line:0%
CHARITY FOLLOWING THE EVENT,

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.393 line:0%
BUT HE SAW HIS CHECK ONLINE AND

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:42.862 line:0%
SOMEONE CROSSED OUT THE CHARITY

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.130 line:0%
NAME AND WROTE ANTHONY, AND

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:48.401 line:0%
OTHER NAME SANTOS HAS USED.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.135 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE RECEIVED NO COMMENT

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:50.904 line:0%
