00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:52.405 line:0%
REGARDING ALL THIS.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:55.975 line:0%
SANTOS WAS ULTIMATELY CHARGED

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:56.676 line:0%
WITH THEFT BY PENNSYLVANIA 30S,

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:58.811 line:0%
BUT THE CHARGES WERE LATER

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:59.579 line:0%
DROPPED AFTER SANTOS MADE A

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.047 line:0%
CLAIM SOMEBODY HAD STOLEN HIS

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:02.916 line:0%
CHECKBOOK, ACCORDING TO A

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:03.316 line:0%
