00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:05.084 line:0%
OF HIS.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:07.020 line:0%
THAT LAWYER, TIFFANY, SAYS SHE

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:08.154 line:0%
NO LONGER BELIEVES HIM.

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:09.656 line:0%
&gt;&gt; HE'S DEFINITELY, YOU KNOW,

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:11.624 line:0%
NOT QUALIFIED TO BE WHERE HE IS

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:12.358 line:0%
IN CONGRESS.

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:16.396 line:0%
HE SHOULD REALLY BE IN JAIL.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:17.564 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS GEORGE SANTOS?

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.331 line:0%
&gt;&gt; RIGHT.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.700 line:0%
&gt;&gt; DO YOU BELIEVE THIS IS THE

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:22.702 line:0%
